            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Slashgrab 0.0.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Add <strong>Copy Path</strong> to Finder’s contextual menu, using the <strong>Copy As</strong> format selected in Slashgrab.</li>
<li>Add a dedicated Settings window for launch at login, Finder integration, updates, and app information.</li>
<li>Improve Finder extension setup, development-build isolation, and signed release packaging.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/prof18/slashgrab/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
